  "text": "<PAGE><BLOCK>header[56, 44, 199, 104]<FORK>W-9\n(Rev. March 2024)\nDepartment of the Treasury\nInternal Revenue Service\n<BLOCK>title[280, 45, 709, 85]<FORK>Request for Taxpayer\nIdentification Number and Certification\n<BLOCK>text[277, 88, 721, 102]<FORK>Go to www.irs.gov/FormW9 for instructions and the latest information.\n<BLOCK>text[810, 54, 938, 95]<FORK>Give form to the requester. Do not send to the IRS.\n<BLOCK>text[56, 107, 636, 120]<FORK>Before you begin. For guidance related to the purpose of Form W-9, see Purpose of Form, below.\n<BLOCK>table[56, 121, 943, 426]<FORK><table><tr><td rowspan=\"7\">See Section 4 for the purpose of Form W-9.</td><td colspan=\"2\">1 Name of entity/individual. An entry is required. (For a sole proprietor or disregarded entity, enter the owner&#x27;s name on line 1, and enter the business/disregarded entity&#x27;s name on line 2.)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">2 Business name/disregarded entity name, if different from above.</td></tr><tr><td>3a Check the appropriate box for federal tax classification of the entity/individual whose name is entered on line 1. Check only one of the following seven boxes.</td><td>4 Exemptions (codes apply only to certain entities, not individuals; see instructions on page 3):</td></tr><tr><td>\u2610 Individual/sole proprietor \u2610 Corporation \u2610 S corporation \u2610 Partnership \u2610 Trust/estate</td><td>Exempt payee code (if any)</td></tr><tr><td>\u2610 LLC. Enter the tax classification (C = C corporation, S = S corporation, P = Partnership) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .